<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-JP Morgan ups Accor target.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-JP Morgan ups Accor target.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan raised its share price target for French hotels group Accor following its in-line results last week, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Repeating its &quot;buy&quot; rating on Accor shares, JP Morgan said it expected Accor's underlying earnings per share to increase 13 percent in the current year and lifted its 12-18 month target to 1,030 francs from 870 francs.</p>
<p>JP Morgan said the stock had risen 36 percent already this year but it expected the re-rating to continue.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
